{
  "id": "DOC-18-Ta065e",
  "title": "Text: DET Greg Garno ↔ Anthony Fenech",
  "date": "2018-11-25",
  "from": "DET Greg Garno",
  "to": "Anthony Fenech",
  "type": "text",
  "subjects": [],
  "content": [
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "7:09 PM",
      "text": "What’s your synopsis of yesterday and the program"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "7:09 PM",
      "text": "Life is pain and Michigan football is part of that."
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "7:14 PM",
      "text": "Yes"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "7:16 PM",
      "text": "No reason to fire Harbaugh though. Guy takes the program 10-2 with a great recruiting class. Just win the fucking game next year"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "7:17 PM",
      "text": "Yeah"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "7:17 PM",
      "text": "That’s not a 10-2 team though"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "7:17 PM",
      "text": "The Big Ten is trash"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "7:18 PM",
      "text": "Ohio St is a well-oiled national title contender. For as much as Harbaugh is getting shit, look at the speed, talent"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "7:18 PM",
      "text": "It wasn’t comparable"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "7:19 PM",
      "text": "I agree, but they don’t deserve to be in the CFP this year. You lose to Purdue you don’t get to go to the playoff. Bama, Clemson, ND, Oklahoma"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "7:20 PM",
      "text": "Yeah that’s fine"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "7:20 PM",
      "text": "They’re better than Notre Dame"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "7:20 PM",
      "text": "But the point is, they’re just at another level"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "7:20 PM",
      "text": "But damn, that was embarrassing"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "7:31 PM",
      "text": "I agree"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "7:33 PM",
      "text": "You should be embarrassed"
    }
  ]
}